5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The noise leaks through that thin wall. I need to know the sound levels.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the monthly costs. We need to see the invoices.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who cleans up after everyone? I want to check the usage tally.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are strangers here. I need to see where awkward talks happen.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to track where our hours go. I will check the facilities callouts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, do the callouts include noise complaints?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the invoices will show if we are overpaying for space.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, if we know where the awkwardness is, maybe we can fix it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, yes. Understanding the friction helps us choose the right room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, I will look at the callouts. They might show maintenance gaps.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the partition wall. It seems too thin.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the quotes for fit-outs. We need to know the price.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the crumbs and bins. It shows who actually uses it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the unplanned talk since the refit. It shows our isolation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the invoices for outside hire. It shows our spending.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. Let us see the facts before we decide.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Yes. Paper figures are safer than guesses.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope the tally shows fairness.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,I hope we find a way to connect again.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us see where the time actually goes.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
