35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is just plasterboard. I can hear everything. And the crumbs are everywhere.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The meeting space costs 141,000 yen. The kitchen is 96,000. We paid 68,000 last year for outside hire.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The two nearest the door used it eleven times. The rest only four. And crumbs are under three keyboards.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The last hard talk happened in front of everyone. Now we only talk by the printer. We are isolated.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Eleven callouts for equipment rooms. None for the empty store. We pay 68,000 for small groups outside.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, 141,000 is a lot. But if we stop leaking noise, maybe it is worth it?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the kitchen is cheaper. But do we need a hob? We just need to eat.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, if we make it a quiet room, maybe people will actually rest? But who cleans the crumbs?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a quiet room might help. But we need a place to talk, not just hide.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the outside hire is for small groups. A meeting space fits that. But the cost is high.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,The noise is the main problem. A quiet room solves that. But we need to address the mess.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The figures show we are paying for space we don't use well. A meeting space might be more efficient.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The tally shows unfair use. A shared calendar for a meeting space could fix that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,A meeting space allows for structured talk. But we need to ensure it is not just for work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The callouts show equipment causes issues. A meeting space has less equipment than a kitchen.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,I lean towards a meeting space. It addresses the noise and the usage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am hesitant about the cost. But the outside hire is also expensive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,A meeting space with a calendar seems fair. I can live with that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,A meeting space could be a place for difficult conversations. I support it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The hours spent on upkeep for a kitchen would be high. A meeting space is simpler.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
